.env
!.env.example
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
*.aiff
*.mp3
*.log
# ── exception: the known-good rollback capture ───────────────────────────────
# `.deploy-staging/known-good-*/LIVE_ACCEPTANCE.log` is NOT a runtime log. It
# is a 1.6 KB one-off acceptance capture that is part of a checksummed
# known-good rollback point, exists nowhere else, and cannot be regenerated.
# The blanket `*.log` above was silently swallowing it, which would have lost a
# unique recovery artefact in the very commit meant to preserve one.
# Verified clean before excepting: zero transcript content (RMS/correlation
# telemetry only), zero absolute paths.
!.deploy-staging/known-good-*/LIVE_ACCEPTANCE.log
*.wav
*.bak
client/*.bak
wake_inference_keys
startup.log
wake-diag.log
wake.log
wake.loggrep
bench/results/
-nexus-globe/
.env.*
.env.save
.DS_Store
tools/*.html
tools/capture/
